            "review_title": "Review at Nam Ranh Quan",
            "review_text": "Alba A\n3 contributions\n0\nThey have cheated us on the price\nAug 2026 • Family\nThe price agreed upon for the seafood when we ordered it was not the same as what they charged us later, a 1,000,000 difference. I don't know if they took advantage of the fact that we were tourists or if it is their usual way of working. Not recommended at all\nTranslated from Spanish\nShow original\nWritten August 18, 2026",
