            "review_title": "Review at Nam Ranh Quan",
            "review_text": "Julie T\nSingapore11 contributions\n0\nAWESOME and value for money seafood dinner\nOct 2023 • Friends\nThe seafood is really very fresh.\n8 of us had fresh prawns crabs and scallops. We had other dishes which is 60000 dong per dish\n\nThe restuarant is mainly for locals.\nThe boss Hua Xuan Hao personally booked for us 2 taxi back to hotel.\n\nWhen going to this restuarant the taxi drivers took a long route to go to CAY SUNG restuarant..probably they get tibs from this CAY SUNG. SO be careful insist on Nam Rahn which is really value for money n the seafood is yummy.\nRead more\nWritten October 12, 2023",
