            "review_title": "Review at Nam Ranh Quan",
            "review_text": "Nancy E\nBellingham, Washington166 contributions\n0\nVenture across the Dragon!\nNov 2022 • Couples\nIf you want to live like a local and eat as much incredible seafood as you want, this is your place. If you want a tourist experience, this is not for you. We just pointed at the pictures on the menu and also at the tanks of very healthy looking shellfish and crustaceans and took our time savoring oysters with herb and nut sauce, sautéed shrimp and a lobster we picked out for grilling along with sampling every local beer they offered. The free boiled peanuts and quail eggs took the edge off while we waited. Everyone else there was a local, and it was quite a festive spot along the waterfront across the river. We walked over and back from center of town across Dragon Bridge (~3.5 km RT) though there were plenty of cabs and Grabs about.\nRead more\nWritten November 2, 2022",
